WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:03.770
We are now in Wean Hall, home
to the Mellon College of Science.

2
00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.306
Right next to us
is one of the four libraries that

3
00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:10.143
we have here on the Pittsburgh campus,
and it's called Sorrells Library.

4
00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:14.147
In there, we have a mix of
group study rooms and quiet spaces,

5
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.416
which are both reservable to all students.

6
00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:21.416
Our libraries here also offer
extensive resources to support academic success

7
00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.557
including 1-on-1 librarian consultations,

8
00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:29.529
research guides and access to a vast
array of digital and physical materials.

9
00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:33.767
Another program I would like to highlight
in here is called the IDA program,

10
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.470
which stands for Integrative Design,
Arts and Technology.

11
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.174
This is an interdisciplinary program
housed in our libraries

12
00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:44.044
consisting of a blend of arts
and technology.

13
00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:45.578
And students in this program

14
00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:49.849
can earn up to a minor with faculty
support from across departments.

15
00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.552
Talking more about the Mellon, College of Science,

16
00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.421
we house four main departments in here,

17
00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:58.858
including biology, mathematics, chemistry and physics

18
00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.660
with 20 different majors in total.

19
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.662
In addition to this building, Wean Hall,

20
00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:06.166
we also have the new
Richard King Mellon Hall of Sciences

21
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.101
that is opening in 2027.

22
00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.504
Something we would also like to
highlight here is our Cloud Lab

23
00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:15.842
which has an automated laboratory
known for being self-driving that enables

24
00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:19.846
traditional experiments to be performed
with AI-enabled instruments,

25
00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:23.783
allowing for greater speed and accuracy
at the touch of one button.

26
00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:27.687
We do also have our Health Professions
program housed here to support

27
00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:31.558
students who's interested in medical
or health careers in the future.

28
00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:32.525
And personally,

29
00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:36.863
a lot of my closest friends in the Mellon
College of Science here have shared

30
00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:41.134
great experiences and support from faculty
as they navigate their plans

31
00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:45.205
post-graduation and being involved
with research here on campus.

32
00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.373
And with that will head to our next stop.

